# Normalise line endings in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this the blobs are LF while a Windows checkout is CRLF, and git
# silently normalises the difference back on commit. Prettier is configured with
# its default endOfLine "lf", so `format:check` fails locally on every file and
# `format` produces a diff git then discards -- which makes it impossible to
# tell a real formatting problem from a line-ending artifact.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated artifacts must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
